    "description": "Twelve male and twelve female healthy University of Sydney students (11 European-Caucasian, 13 Southeast Asian). Age and BMI are mean +/- SD for all 24 (not given by sex); each arm uses one sex. Each fast length was tested three times per person (the table footnotes' n = 36 is 12 people x 3 tests per sex per fast length); uncertainty n is the 12 people."
